              "value": "(death, divine, necromancy)\n\nTrigger: The warsworn moves into a dying creature's space.\n\nThe warsworn absorbs the dying creature into itself, instantly killing the creature and healing the warsworn for a number of Hit Points equal to the creature's level. As long as the warsworn still exists, absorbed creatures can't be resurrected except by wish or a similarly powerful effect."
